	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" /></head>
<body class="wp-singular page-template page-template-elementor_canvas page page-id-112 wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-twentytwentyfive elementor-default elementor-template-canvas elementor-kit-4 elementor-page elementor-page-112">
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="112" class="elementor elementor-112">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00000 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00000-s " data-id="e00000" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00000">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00004-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00004">HOUSECELL</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">MODULAR HOME BATTERY · UK</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00006 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00006-s " data-id="e00006" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00006">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    			<h1 data-interaction-id="e00008" class="e-ykrhga-e00008-s e-heading-base">Start with one. Stack to four. Stop guessing at the payback.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00009">A 5kWh home battery that clips together with more of itself. Housecell shows you what it earned you today in pounds, not in kilowatt-hours, so you can tell whether it was worth it.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000a-s " data-id="e0000a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b"><a href="#survey" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a free survey
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c">MCS registered · fitted in one day</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000d-s " data-id="e0000d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000d">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s" data-interaction-id="e0000e" id="109" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-housecell-home-battery_wall.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-housecell-home-battery_wall.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-housecell-home-battery_wall-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="Two stacked Housecell battery modules mounted on a utility room wall"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g">PAYBACK</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000h-s " data-id="e0000h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">6y 4m</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">TWO UNITS · TOU TARIFF</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000k">Typical payback on a two-unit system with a time-of-use tariff: 6 years 4 months. With solar and an EV, <strong>4 years 9 months</strong>.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000l-s " data-id="e0000l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">CAPACITY</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000n-s " data-id="e0000n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000o">5.2</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000p">KWH USABLE PER UNIT</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000q">5.2kWh usable per unit, 3.6kW continuous output, four units maximum on a single-phase supply.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000r-s " data-id="e0000r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000s">BLACKOUT</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000t-s " data-id="e0000t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">12ms</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">CUTOVER</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000w">Cuts over in 12 milliseconds. Your fridge, lights, router and one ring circuit stay live. The oven and the shower do not, and we will tell you that before you buy.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000x-s " data-id="e0000x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000z e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0000z-s " data-id="e0000z" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00010 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00010-s " data-id="e00010" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00010">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00011-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00011">SIZING</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00012" class="e-ykrhga-e00012-s e-heading-base">How many units your house actually needs</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013">Every unit is the same 5.2kWh brick. You are not buying a size, you are buying a count — and you can change the count later without changing anything else on the wall.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00014 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00014-s " data-id="e00014" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00014">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00015 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00015-s " data-id="e00015" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00015">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00016-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00016">1</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00017-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00017">5.2 KWH</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00018" class="e-ykrhga-e00018-s e-heading-base">One unit</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00019-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00019">Flat or small terrace, no solar. Covers the evening peak and not much more.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001a-s " data-id="e0001a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001b-s " data-id="e0001b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001c">2</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001d">10.4 KWH</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001e" class="e-ykrhga-e0001e-s e-heading-base">Two units</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">The common answer. Three or four bed semi with around 4kW of solar.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001h-s " data-id="e0001h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001i">3</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001j">15.6 KWH</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001k" class="e-ykrhga-e0001k-s e-heading-base">Three units</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001l">Bigger house, an EV charging at home, or a heat pump running overnight.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001m-s " data-id="e0001m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001m">
