    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001w">WHEN THE STREET GOES DARK</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001x" class="e-ykrhga-e0001x-s e-heading-base">Twelve milliseconds, and a short list of things that stay on</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001y">The changeover is fast enough that your router never reboots. What it is not is a whole-house generator, and pretending otherwise is how people end up disappointed on the one night it matters.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001z">A two-unit system runs the list below for roughly 14 hours.</p>
		
</div>
