    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003q">LAST MONTH</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003r-s " data-id="e0003r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">£71</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003t">AVERAGE TWO-UNIT SAVING</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003u">Charges on the cheap overnight rate, discharges during the expensive window, and learns your house over about three weeks. Last month the average two-unit customer saved <strong>£71</strong>.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003v">The app reports it in pounds. Kilowatt-hours are there if you want them, on the second tab, where they belong.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

