<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004n-s " data-id="e0004n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004o-s " data-id="e0004o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">6,000</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004q">CYCLES</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004r">Counted by the unit, reported in the app.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004s-s " data-id="e0004s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004t-s " data-id="e0004t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">80%</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004v">CAPACITY FLOOR</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004w">The number the warranty is measured against.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004x-s " data-id="e0004x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004y">WARRANTY</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004z" class="e-ykrhga-e0004z-s e-heading-base">Modules, not systems</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00050-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00050">10 years or 6,000 cycles to 80 percent capacity, whichever is later. Modules are individually replaceable so one failure does not mean a new system.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00051 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00051-s " data-id="e00051" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00051">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">REAL NUMBERS · FOUR INSTALLED HOMES</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00056" class="e-ykrhga-e00056-s e-heading-base">What four actual houses banked in twelve months</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">A 1930s semi in Sheffield with 4kW of solar and two units: £612 saved in twelve months. The full dataset for all four homes is downloadable.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00059 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00059-s " data-id="e00059" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00059">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005a-s " data-id="e0005a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Sheffield · S7</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005c">£612</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">saved in twelve months</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">A 1930s semi with 4kW of solar and two units. Time-of-use tariff, no EV.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">Bristol · BS9</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">£884</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005j">saved in twelve months</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">A 1980s detached with 6kW of solar, an EV on the drive and three units.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005m-s " data-id="e0005m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005n">Leeds · LS6</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">£237</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">saved in twelve months</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">A Victorian terrace with no solar at all. One unit, arbitrage only.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005r-s " data-id="e0005r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005s-s " data-id="e0005s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t">Norwich · NR2</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005u">£498</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">saved in twelve months</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">A 2019 new-build with 3.6kW of solar, a heat pump and two units.</p>
		
</div>

